{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"upperclass-aquamarine-whippet","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Context\n\n`docs/your-first-change.md` still downloads the Gerrit hook directly, permits a small patch to bypass Gerrit, and recommends `recheck` when a failure only appears flaky. Ticket fat-leaflike-canary introduced the tutorial. Tickets sultanlike-doughty-civet and sure-starred-springtail superseded its hook and retry instructions. Current project policy requires `make hooks`, Gerrit passage for every change to main, and root-cause work for nondeterministic tests.\n\n## Plan\n\n- Replace direct hook download with the supported `make hooks` command.\n- Explain that a maintainer may sponsor a contribution while its change still passes through Gerrit before main.\n- Remove the small-patch bypass.\n- Reserve `recheck` for demonstrated environmental faults.\n- Direct nondeterministic test failures to the project debugging workflow and root-cause remediation.\n- Add a narrow documentation contract for these process requirements and run documentation link checks.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] The tutorial installs hooks only through `make hooks`.\n- [ ] The tutorial states that every change to main passes through Gerrit.\n- [ ] Maintainer sponsorship is described without a Gerrit bypass.\n- [ ] `recheck` is reserved for demonstrated environmental faults.\n- [ ] Nondeterministic test failures direct contributors to root-cause work.\n- [ ] The focused tutorial contract and documentation link checks pass.","id":"b458-e422-e200-4be9","parent_id":"b8bf-a5aa-2f4d-44d4","priority":1,"tags":["documentation","accuracy","f29"],"ticket_type":"task","title":"F29 correct the first contribution tutorial"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1787511024506147001,"uuid":"5a20db61-11fa-4ff7-a761-273e050e5445"}